    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d603">

                <pb facs="0766" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg658"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Governor Nicholls to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New Orleans, La</hi>.</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1890</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I do not apprehend any trouble; there was for a time some excitement resulting
                    from the killing of the chief of police and the manner of his taking off, but
                    there is no occasion, and has been no occasion, for any executive action or
                    unusual action in the premises.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis T. Nicholls</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Governor</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
